            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper presents the analysis of balloon dilations of the coronary arteries in 18 patients with ischemic heart disease. A multimodality clinical examination of the patients involving provocative tests and echocardiography is recommended to be performed both preoperatively and postoperatively.</AbstractText>
